      "label": "(2.3)",
      "name": "Black–Scholes partial differential equation",
      "statement": "The value of the option satisfies an equation in which its change with time, half the squared volatility times the squared stock price times its curvature in the stock price, the risk-free rate times the stock price times its slope in the stock price, and minus the risk-free rate times its value add up to zero.",
